{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "1f380151-8303-59bc-bcb5-ff62100bea68", "source_ordinal": 4104, "reading_ordinal": 4243, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "上三路", "published_at": "2026-09-03T13:02:57.924000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2041435157605914612/answer/2078829736462119557"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "先看第一路：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 6}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "出身背景妨不妨碍你热爱钓鱼？", "char_start": 7, "char_end": 21}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "如果你擅长钓鱼，钓到的鱼本身就能覆盖你钓鱼的成本、几乎可以零成本起步。靠钓鱼本身你就可以买鱼竿、饱肚子，养家。你要是能拿比赛名次、你还能拿奖金、开直播、授课、带货。", "char_start": 22, "char_end": 104}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "实话实说——一个钓鱼王可以赚很多钱。", "char_start": 105, "char_end": 123}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "那么在你拿起那根钓竿时，面前的池与鱼，有查过你的出身吗？", "char_start": 124, "char_end": 152}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "会不会因为你出身农家或者豪门而区别对待你？", "char_start": 153, "char_end": 174}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你钓到了鱼，去农贸市场出手，摊主会查户口吗？会问家里几口人，爸妈何处高就吗？", "char_start": 175, "char_end": 213}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你技艺日精，勇夺魁首的时候，组委会因为你出身贫寒而扣下奖杯吗？", "char_start": 214, "char_end": 245}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "自然规律不问出身，高低贵贱在它面前一律平等，你掌握好自然规律就可以安身立命甚至出人头地了。甚至，因为你出身寒微，你站上讲台时人给你鼓掌欢呼还更大声。", "char_start": 246, "char_end": 320}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "对于搞招聘、选人的，张三李四的出身背景各不相同，这对选人的人才是变量，才会把这东西和张三李四的努力放在一起看，去谈这重不重要。", "char_start": 321, "char_end": 384}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "你要靠人赏饭碗的话，出身确实对那些挑选你的人有这样那样的意义——即便如此，人也未必总是觉得家庭条件好的候选人更优胜，没准选拔条件是看谁更能挺住大训练量和高挑战性的考验，是选运动苗子。好家庭条件并不总是加分项。", "char_start": 385, "char_end": 489}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "而你如果是朝天要活路的，老天爷不关心你是帝王将相还是牛鬼蛇神，是先进学生代表还是劳改释放人员。", "char_start": 490, "char_end": 537}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "ta只关心你水温烧到了几度，打磨到不到位，击球部位正不正。", "char_start": 538, "char_end": 567}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你安心把自己的技艺练好，本分尽到，保持探索精神精益求精就好了，别担心那么多出身问题。", "char_start": 568, "char_end": 610}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "再看第二路：", "char_start": 611, "char_end": 617}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "“出身背景比努力重要”的理论还有一个非常难解释的问题——出身背景极为接近的人，为什么命运一个天上一个地下。", "char_start": 618, "char_end": 671}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "不是说好出身背景更重要吗？那不是最多应该只有30%收入差异吗？怎么搞到一个流离失所，一个金玉满堂？", "char_start": 672, "char_end": 721}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "再看第三路：", "char_start": 722, "char_end": 728}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "其实说实话，对绝大多数人而言，一生的财富大部分都是来自劳动和经营，只有很少是来自继承。你只是没仔细算账，仔细算算你一生的劳动总收入其实一般都要比父母给你的遗产多很多。", "char_start": 729, "char_end": 812}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "你的父母们几乎就没从ta们的父母手里继承什么东西，人人都是白手起家。如果不是这样，ta们又哪来什么财富好留给你，成为你的“出身”？", "char_start": 813, "char_end": 878}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "生产力持续发展的时代，人的努力有时代变革的加成放大作用，努力在人生中所占的比重还要比生产方式百年难得一变时更大，从比例上更会压倒从继承而来的静态份额。", "char_start": 879, "char_end": 954}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "三路论证，都放这了。", "char_start": 955, "char_end": 965}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "其实老实说，这些东西都是明摆着的，你心里都知道，不是吗？", "char_start": 966, "char_end": 994}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "你之所以要问这问题，其实是想找点支持出身更重要的答案，来抚慰一下自己现在努力的痛苦和早年懈怠努力的悔恨，是吗？", "char_start": 995, "char_end": 1050}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "其实我差不多理解你为什么需要这个安慰，这样的无力感、悔恨感，人人都或多或少有过。哪怕是郎朗那样的天才，在遇到人上有人时也难免会有自惭形秽，觉得人家出身名门，自己差距悬殊，一辈子也追不上的时候。", "char_start": 1051, "char_end": 1147}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "谁都有，ta有，你有，我也有。", "char_start": 1148, "char_end": 1163}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "甚至你、我、ta所羡慕、敬畏的人，也一样有——ta前头也有ta望不到顶的人或事。", "char_start": 1164, "char_end": 1204}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "这时候你记住——那是人的ego在作祟。", "char_start": 1205, "char_end": 1224}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "那不是你的使命。", "char_start": 1225, "char_end": 1233}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "你的使命不是要搞什么天下无敌、一人之下万人之上，不是爬上去然后耀武扬威。", "char_start": 1234, "char_end": 1270}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "你的使命只是扮演好你现在身负的角色——做个负责任的、不辱使命的子女、配偶、父母、同事、服务者。", "char_start": 1271, "char_end": 1318}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "你是历史大剧中的一个角色，这个角色有自己的戏份，这些戏份不论你自己怎么看，其实都是整出戏里不可缺少的一部分。", "char_start": 1319, "char_end": 1373}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "你有你的角色，ta有ta的角色。每一个人其实都是扇动翅膀最后会引起风暴的蝴蝶。每一个人到底有多关键，其实只有历史的总编剧知道。", "char_start": 1374, "char_end": 1437}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "别去羡慕张三李四，觉得ta们的戏份更好，肯定更重要，觉得自己的东西一无是处、微不足道。", "char_start": 1438, "char_end": 1481}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "世事难料——做《牛来》的母子在短短半个月前不也是这样想的吗？", "char_start": 1482, "char_end": 1512}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "低头看路，把自己的角色扮演好，为自己演得好好的店小二、兵丁甲感到自豪和欣喜。", "char_start": 1513, "char_end": 1551}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "阿发的岳父不就得了最佳表演奖吗？", "char_start": 1552, "char_end": 1568}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "在你的剧里，帝王将相反而是背景，你这小兵才是主角。", "char_start": 1569, "char_end": 1594}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "当好你的男主角、女主角，你不知道导演编剧后面是怎么安排的——说实在的，命运的编剧根本不关心你的出身，笔头一转让人突然成为明星的剧情多了去了。", "char_start": 1595, "char_end": 1665}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "在自己的位置上、自己的水平上做自己力所能及的努力，别管什么这能不能“跃升阶层、改变命运”。", "char_start": 1666, "char_end": 1711}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "钓鱼、编程、拍视频本身自有乐趣，想法子享受它的乐趣。", "char_start": 1712, "char_end": 1738}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "学会沉迷，永远不晚。", "char_start": 1739, "char_end": 1749}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "其实恰恰是你一直纠缠在这些悔恨、自卑、怨怼之中，才耽误了你去好好享受“做功”本身的乐趣。", "char_start": 1750, "char_end": 1794}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "你被这些杂质、毒素所扰，只觉得努力是一种折磨，而你无限的回避努力，毫无变化的困境只会让你更深的陷入绝望，让你更痛苦。", "char_start": 1795, "char_end": 1853}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "丢掉那些东西，别听它们的欺骗了——我这里递了好几副耳塞给你了。", "char_start": 1854, "char_end": 1885}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "body", "index": 46, "text": "其实努力本身是有乐趣的，甚至可以让你上瘾。", "char_start": 1886, "char_end": 1907}, {"paragraph_id": "P047", "field": "body", "index": 47, "text": "别为了它能换到的那些名利去努力，而要为它的瘾头去沉迷。", "char_start": 1908, "char_end": 1935}, {"paragraph_id": "P048", "field": "body", "index": 48, "text": "等你过完瘾抬起头来，很容易就又是一片新天地了。", "char_start": 1936, "char_end": 1959}, {"paragraph_id": "P049", "field": "body", "index": 49, "text": "歇口气，去在努力里寻找乐趣吧。", "char_start": 1960, "char_end": 1975}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 49}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0602"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：人这一生到底是出生背景重要，还是后天努力更重要？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046", "P047", "P048", "P049"], "summary": "围绕“上三路”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“先看第一路：”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "先看第一路：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 6, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "ca0b3f1d-5826-5342-a190-101a11e647f2", "source_ordinal": 4103, "reading_ordinal": 4244, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "护犊", "published_at": "2026-09-03T15:40:17.134000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/627735021/answer/2078869452842603250"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "保护孩子是父母的天职，这是没什么可说的。但是保护孩子要谨慎使用武力，否则可能给孩子造成很大的心理创伤和长期影响。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 56}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "有东西侵扰了孩子，孩子吓哭了，接着父亲就会对这东西发动生死搏斗，血溅三尺，这样的结果带给孩子的其实并不是“十足的安全感”，而是一种焦虑和恐惧。", "char_start": 57, "char_end": 128}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "孩子会不再敢轻易哭泣和求救。", "char_start": 129, "char_end": 143}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "因为ta会害怕自己一哭，就会导致父母卷入生死搏斗，导致新的伤亡。", "char_start": 144, "char_end": 176}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "会有新的流血和死亡。", "char_start": 177, "char_end": 187}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "现在是小狗，以后说不定是和自己吵架的朋友。", "char_start": 188, "char_end": 209}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "孩子是爱父母的，其实天然的有不愿意给父母添麻烦的体贴。", "char_start": 210, "char_end": 237}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "因为自己哭了一下，让父母卷入了如此激烈的矛盾，如此惨烈的后果，对孩子其实是需要做心理治疗的刺激。", "char_start": 238, "char_end": 286}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "不及时治疗，很可能导致她长期自我封闭，回避与其它任何人的接触。而且刺激出一种特殊的扭曲性适应——为了怕刺激父亲的激烈反应、长期不自觉的自我压抑和讨好ta人，而又在这时候高压抑状态下难以持久，在筋疲力竭之后因为小触动而一次性的、崩溃性的发作，反而极大的刺激起父亲的应激反应——因为那看上去极其类似“有坏孩子长期欺负我善良温柔的娃，最终导致她情绪崩溃”。", "char_start": 287, "char_end": 462}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这样的观感很容易再次刺激起本就情绪激烈，奉行“超额报复”原则的父母。", "char_start": 463, "char_end": 497}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "如果孩子一再验证“只要我一崩溃，就会有人流血，会导致父母陷入激烈纠纷”，那就很难救治了。", "char_start": 498, "char_end": 542}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "她别无选择，只能自我流放，自己与世隔绝了。", "char_start": 543, "char_end": 564}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "父母要保护孩子，要做的是隔离、降服和重建稳定的安全。", "char_start": 565, "char_end": 591}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "隔离，是指阻断伤害企及子女的途径，拦在威胁和子女之间。", "char_start": 592, "char_end": 619}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "降伏，是指有效的博弈，让对方了解无机可乘、无利可图而且最后一定得不偿失，自己主动避免类似情况发生。", "char_start": 620, "char_end": 669}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "重建安全，是指重新恢复到可持续的和平状态。最好是“不打不相识”的和解、友好状态，如果这一点不可追求，也至少是没有极端仇恨、怨怼残留的稳定状态。", "char_start": 670, "char_end": 741}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "而这个三阶段，是不宜用雷霆万钧的极端暴力做开头的。", "char_start": 742, "char_end": 767}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这位父亲有情绪管理上的问题，这个事情处理得很是不好。", "char_start": 768, "char_end": 794}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "其实他发一个视频向狗主人舆论施压，也要比直接动手杀戮要好，这样有理反而弄成了无理，对家庭的具体实际处境后患不小。", "char_start": 795, "char_end": 851}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "杀戮是无可逆的，自认为“全额赔偿”就算“承担了全部后果”，恐怕没有任何一个养育宠物的人会认同。", "char_start": 852, "char_end": 899}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "这把人的感情看得毫无价值了，对人是极为不尊重的。", "char_start": 900, "char_end": 924}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "宜引以为戒。", "char_start": 925, "char_end": 931}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 22}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0602"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：男子手持铁锹将未拴绳柯基打死，派出所「狗扑向打狗男子的女儿，在调查处理」，调查后续如何？怎样看待此事？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022"], "summary": "围绕“护犊”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“保护孩子是父母的天职，这是没什么可说的。但是保护孩子要谨慎使用武力，否则可能给孩子造成很大的心理创伤和长期影响。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "保护孩子是父母的天职，这是没什么可说的。但是保护孩子要谨慎使用武力，否则可能给孩子造成很大的心理创伤和长期影响。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 56, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "1fe28dda-3e35-5a05-95bc-18612f2078c5", "source_ordinal": 4102, "reading_ordinal": 4245, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "那活着的", "published_at": "2026-09-04T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/667394283/answer/2076187472955024248"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "先说泛化的葬礼礼仪问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 12}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "你无法承受复杂的葬礼传统，问题不是出在不孝，而在于你对传统礼仪没有信仰。", "char_start": 13, "char_end": 49}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "在比较保守的地区以及老一辈心里，对完备的葬礼的执着还是比较深的，没做好会觉得影响运势，妨碍吉凶。", "char_start": 50, "char_end": 98}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这是一整个的信仰熏陶问题。", "char_start": 99, "char_end": 112}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你没这个熏陶，勉强你去信不太现实。这跟孝顺、亲子感情关系不大，这就像你很爱父母，也忍不了ta们花很多钱去买那些你觉得根本是骗人的保健品一样。", "char_start": 113, "char_end": 183}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "同样的钱请父母坐游轮、出去玩、吃美食，你不会舍不得。", "char_start": 184, "char_end": 210}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "可见这个“不买保健品”和是否尽孝没有关系。", "char_start": 211, "char_end": 232}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这类葬礼也是一样。", "char_start": 233, "char_end": 242}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "你不信而已、不信就不拘了。", "char_start": 243, "char_end": 256}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "另寻别的方式表达哀思吧。", "char_start": 257, "char_end": 269}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "再说你这具体的案例——这很明显是你母亲感到孤独、焦虑，所以对你、对你的家人特别思念，想要看到你们。", "char_start": 271, "char_end": 320}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "可怜父母心，她都没有说是自己想你们，是自己需要你们，而是用父亲仪式的名头。", "char_start": 321, "char_end": 358}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "而且为了迁就你，让步了又让步。", "char_start": 359, "char_end": 374}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "她似乎不愿意成为你的负担，在小心翼翼的避免造成你的压力呢。", "char_start": 375, "char_end": 404}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "希望实情是我想多了，否则我一个外人，想到你母亲刚失去了自己一生的伴侣，而唯一的儿子在千里之外，即使以刚刚故去的亡父的名，也怎么呼唤也都呼唤不回，真的有点为她心酸。", "char_start": 405, "char_end": 486}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你有难处，做父母的永远会体谅。", "char_start": 487, "char_end": 502}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "何况脚长在你身上，除了体谅，ta们又能如何呢？", "char_start": 503, "char_end": 526}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "但就算决定了不回去、回不去，还是尽量温柔一点向母亲表示歉疚和理解吧。", "char_start": 527, "char_end": 561}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "把这事往“算不算对父亲不孝”上苦恼，其实有些离题了。", "char_start": 562, "char_end": 588}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "母亲还活着，活着的人更重要。", "char_start": 589, "char_end": 603}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "祝你们平安。", "char_start": 604, "char_end": 610}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 22}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0602"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：父亲今年5月份去世，我对后续的烧七、烧百天、烧生日、烧周年很不耐烦，是不是不孝？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021"], "summary": "围绕“那活着的”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“先说泛化的葬礼礼仪问题。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "先说泛化的葬礼礼仪问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 12, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "037b0e4b-bb8a-5d5d-abd9-dafcd0be03e0", "source_ordinal": 4101, "reading_ordinal": 4246, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "智能寒门", "published_at": "2026-09-04T23:55:54.064000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1997376980287513267/answer/1997958812796220653"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "其实AI有一个很大的悖论，那就是能用好AI的人必须在用AI之前先练好基本功。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 38}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "比如说一位用AI做原画的画手，ta最好在开始用AI之前先有一个扎实的传统画功底子，能极好的掌握透视、规划构图、管理色彩平衡和光影布局、质感对比等等美学要素，然后再依赖AI去极大的放大自己的效率。", "char_start": 39, "char_end": 136}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "如果一开始没有这个底子，画个人连四肢长度都搞不对称，基本透视错误都看不出来，那么给了AI工具做出来的也往往是品味不佳、格调低下、平平无奇之作。", "char_start": 137, "char_end": 208}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "然而糟糕的是什么呢？", "char_start": 209, "char_end": 219}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "是有了AI之后，要人老老实实坐在小板凳上，用铅笔一笔一笔画石膏，这比起没有AI之前真是难得多了。", "char_start": 220, "char_end": 268}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "随便画两笔，AI就可以给你补成精美的画面，你还耐得住性子自己去调颜料、洗笔刷、绷画布吗？", "char_start": 269, "char_end": 313}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "同理，编程也一样。", "char_start": 315, "char_end": 324}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "写作也一样。", "char_start": 325, "char_end": 331}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "学医也一样。", "char_start": 332, "char_end": 338}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "因为有AI，难练基本功，而又因为没有基本功，难以用好AI。", "char_start": 340, "char_end": 369}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这不是先有鸡还是先有蛋的问题，而是鸡要吃鸡蛋的问题。", "char_start": 370, "char_end": 396}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "事实上，你是不需要去学ComfyUI的。", "char_start": 397, "char_end": 417}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "把学那些复杂的工具流界面的功夫省下来，还是先去学你的基本功吧。", "char_start": 418, "char_end": 449}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你放心，过不了多久这些复杂的界面操作就会被更自然、更省略的界面替代，到时候花大量时间学习怎么填参数、怎么调prompt、怎么拉流程线的功夫都会白费。", "char_start": 450, "char_end": 524}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "稀缺的不会是熟知这些界面技巧的操作手，而是真的知道美是什么、工程的健壮性是什么、规划的合理性是什么、何谓优、何谓劣的打磨过的头脑。", "char_start": 525, "char_end": 590}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "而这些东西，和那些一手一脚的基本功有很大的关系，是不能简单的用自动化手段替代的。", "char_start": 591, "char_end": 631}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "其实现在二十、三十多岁的专业精英是最幸运的一代，ta们在传统教育和专业实践中免于AI打扰而先练好了基本功。反而是现在还在读小学、中学的孩子们有点麻烦——ta们之中不知有多少会被AI引诱着去追逐皮相迷人的空壳。", "char_start": 632, "char_end": 736}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "最后很大程度上下一代的竞争是在争谁能对虚假的酷炫表现免疫。", "char_start": 737, "char_end": 766}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "看谁在AI时代还能沉得住性子沉溺于基本功中。", "char_start": 767, "char_end": 789}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "只能拭目以待了。", "char_start": 790, "char_end": 798}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 23}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0602"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何看待「不会用AI的家庭将是新寒门」的观点，AI改变教育模式的当下，该如何在学习中合理使用AI？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020"], "summary": "围绕“智能寒门”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“其实AI有一个很大的悖论，那就是能用好AI的人必须在用AI之前先练好基本功。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "其实AI有一个很大的悖论，那就是能用好AI的人必须在用AI之前先练好基本功。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 38, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "84d048a3-482c-52c6-99b5-8832e81f20e4", "source_ordinal": 4100, "reading_ordinal": 4247, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "小喜过望", "published_at": "2026-09-05T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://www.ifdian.net/p/86ddba24a32111f188545254001e7c00"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "最好的办法，就是做好下一份作业。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "无论你要干什么，都是一份一份的作业。", "char_start": 17, "char_end": 35}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "做好一份，再做下一份。", "char_start": 36, "char_end": 47}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你出问题，必然出在这样一个状态——所有的作业你都做得不满意，而且这些作业是互相影响的。A作业没做好于是心情不好，于是B作业也就没做好，你为了把B作业做好，多花了点时间，于是C作业没有时间了，C作业也没做好。为了把C作业好歹糊弄圆场，于是你牺牲了休息、娱乐的时间，但没有娱乐你感到痛苦，没有睡眠你感到疲劳。", "char_start": 48, "char_end": 200}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "于是第二天的A作业你又没做好。", "char_start": 201, "char_end": 216}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "于是你心情又不好，接着一路下去，昨天的故事一二三四五依次重演一遍。", "char_start": 217, "char_end": 250}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你又痛苦的陷入新的疲劳。", "char_start": 251, "char_end": 263}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "坏消息是每一天都似噩梦重来。", "char_start": 264, "char_end": 278}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "好消息是你似乎也就这样稳住了——日复一日，你不满意，但事情也没怎么变坏。", "char_start": 279, "char_end": 315}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你不是没有做好过的时候，有时你干得很漂亮，提前完成了任务。你很兴奋、很高兴，于是你决定庆祝一下。你吃了顿好的，还奖励自己打了好几盘游戏。", "char_start": 316, "char_end": 384}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "兴奋到深夜，你才好不容易睡着。", "char_start": 385, "char_end": 400}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "早上闹钟把你叫醒时，你意识到——你甚至比前一天睡得更少。", "char_start": 401, "char_end": 429}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "于是你的A作业又没做好。", "char_start": 430, "char_end": 442}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "看到没有？", "char_start": 443, "char_end": 448}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "你有过改善循环的机会，但是你用“奖励自己多玩一会儿游戏”的方式，把这些运气带给你的那份额外的收益用掉了。", "char_start": 449, "char_end": 501}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这是“改变自己”最具体、最现实的问题。", "char_start": 502, "char_end": 521}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "人们总是在平衡线上苦苦挣扎，然而一旦稍稍离开平衡线，又往往把关键的剩余用来“庆祝离开平衡线”。", "char_start": 522, "char_end": 569}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "然后又跌回平衡线——甚至跌得更深。", "char_start": 570, "char_end": 587}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "你要想办法解决这个问题。", "char_start": 588, "char_end": 600}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "而解决问题的关键，是不要为“今天完成得很出色”过于兴奋。", "char_start": 601, "char_end": 629}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "高兴是应该的，也是必然的，但一定要小心，不要把这场小胜仗的收获浪费在庆祝上了。", "char_start": 630, "char_end": 669}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "真正值得庆祝的不是“这次干得不错”，而是“持续循环的改善”。", "char_start": 670, "char_end": 700}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "你要把这次的出色表现争取到的富余时间和精力优先投入到“提高明天复现今天成功的概率”上。", "char_start": 701, "char_end": 744}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "也就是要拿来睡觉，拿来洗澡，拿来拉伸、按摩，拿来帮助自己明天有一个更好的起点。", "char_start": 745, "char_end": 784}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "但不要强迫自己第二天一定复现今天的表现——这有一定运气成分。", "char_start": 785, "char_end": 815}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "这也是为什么我们把目标称为“提高复现好表现的概率”。", "char_start": 816, "char_end": 842}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "比如，你五天才有一次好表现，成功率1/5，你提高了休息和锻炼，你的表现概率提高到了1/4。", "char_start": 843, "char_end": 888}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "然而1/4的概率意味着明天你能连续做出好表现的概率只有1/4，没有直接复现是正常的。", "char_start": 889, "char_end": 931}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "不要担心，这是正常的。", "char_start": 932, "char_end": 943}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "你要的是这次四天就有一次好表现，这并没有多难。", "char_start": 944, "char_end": 967}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "这次你再有了好表现，再次把得到的额外精力投入到自身的休息和效率之中，把概率提高到1/3。", "char_start": 968, "char_end": 1012}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "以此类推。", "char_start": 1013, "char_end": 1018}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "最后真正让你快乐的，不是一次两次的好表现，而是这条增长曲线。", "char_start": 1019, "char_end": 1049}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "然后你就会发现你改变了，因为这条持续向上的曲线才是你要的“改变”。", "char_start": 1050, "char_end": 1083}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "这就是改变自己的公式，就这么简单，试试吧。", "char_start": 1084, "char_end": 1105}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 36}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0602"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：改变自己最好的办法是什么？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035"], "summary": "围绕“小喜过望”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“最好的办法，就是做好下一份作业。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "最好的办法，就是做好下一份作业。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "a439c81a-95a1-5407-bf12-79a58c908f6b", "source_ordinal": 4099, "reading_ordinal": 4248, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "可谓之仁", "published_at": "2026-09-05T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://www.ifdian.net/p/98659788a25111f180855254001e7c00"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "如果你知道对方的心理伤痕在哪，这个问题很好解决。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 24}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "比如你知道对方父母双亡，当然不会傻到大谈天伦之乐。", "char_start": 25, "char_end": 50}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "真正的挑战在于——你如何在不知道别人的心理伤痕的时候避免触及对方的心理伤痕？", "char_start": 51, "char_end": 89}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "一种做法是索性什么涉及人的话题都不提，谈天气，谈火星，谈雪茄，谈辨别青蛙性别，谈高效清除葡萄酒渍、谈发动机除碳……", "char_start": 90, "char_end": 147}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这是一个聪明的做法，相当好用——所以你平时要做个有趣的人，事事留意，多做钻研。", "char_start": 148, "char_end": 187}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "谁不喜欢什么话题都接得住的健谈之友呢？", "char_start": 188, "char_end": 207}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "另一种做法，就是不要轻易对任何角色人物做尖刻评价。", "char_start": 208, "char_end": 233}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "比如，不要说“喝酒开车的人纯属自己找死”，不要说“老百姓炒股赔死都是活该”，不要说“跑海船的没几个干净的”，不要说“跑滴滴的迟早要得肾病”……", "char_start": 234, "char_end": 305}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "不要随便对人——甚至是对有生命的动物——说残忍、尖刻的话。", "char_start": 306, "char_end": 335}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "连“我只要看到流浪狗就恨不得踢两脚”这类说动物的话都不要。", "char_start": 336, "char_end": 365}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "因为对方的孩子可能就是酒驾身亡，对方的狗可能就是被路人打伤残疾的。", "char_start": 366, "char_end": 399}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "你自认为“没有任何问题”的一句“正论”，随时都可能让人痛彻心扉。", "char_start": 400, "char_end": 432}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "你可能觉得你是无心的，甚至对方也知道你是无心的，但那份锥心刺骨的痛苦仍然避免不了，对方看到你就忍不住心里一缩，想起你说这话时那副不容置疑、踌躇满志的表情，就是知道你是无心的，也没法克制ta自己的痛苦一跳一跳的疼。", "char_start": 433, "char_end": 539}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "结果还能好到哪去呢？", "char_start": 540, "char_end": 550}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "所以，也许你在社交平台上，在网络身份与现实身份有所隔离的前提下，可以言辞尖锐一些，但只要是当着真人的面，就一定要时时存着慈心、善念。", "char_start": 551, "char_end": 617}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "heading", "index": 16, "text": "勿轻褒贬。", "char_start": 618, "char_end": 623}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你不知人的深浅，无论怎么努力，除非完全闭嘴不说话，否则做不到“不触”，但你可以努力做到“触而不痛”。", "char_start": 624, "char_end": 674}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "做一个温柔的人，一个无怨无恨的人，一个不相信仇恨和惩罚的人。", "char_start": 675, "char_end": 705}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "反而不憎，抗而不暴，责而不苛，可以谓之仁也。", "char_start": 706, "char_end": 728}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "仁爱在心，你就能获得畅所欲言而不生罪与祸的自由。", "char_start": 729, "char_end": 753}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "人知道你是何等样人，也会放心的向往与你交谈。", "char_start": 754, "char_end": 776}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "而且因为你对一切都没有怨恨和轻蔑，你也就不必为了怕惹祸而过度费心去察言观色。", "char_start": 777, "char_end": 815}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "你也会轻松很多。", "char_start": 816, "char_end": 824}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "对方放松，你也放松，所有的对话都自然是抚慰的、治愈的。", "char_start": 825, "char_end": 852}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "你能治愈，岂会不得人喜爱呢？", "char_start": 853, "char_end": 867}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "试试吧。", "char_start": 868, "char_end": 872}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 25, "heading": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0602"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：聊天的时候如何尽量避免触及对方的心理伤痕？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026"], "summary": "围绕“可谓之仁”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“如果你知道对方的心理伤痕在哪，这个问题很好解决。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "如果你知道对方的心理伤痕在哪，这个问题很好解决。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 24, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "95c2bafd-46c4-51f6-a4e1-c661dc539ab1", "source_ordinal": 4098, "reading_ordinal": 4249, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "寒与微", "published_at": "2026-09-05T13:15:53.675000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2066125049493562641/answer/2079558144523555468"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "什么叫一门手艺？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "不是随便什么手工操作都算手艺，而是基于人工的、足以臻于艺术的技艺才称为手艺。", "char_start": 9, "char_end": 47}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "要进入艺术的境界，才足够立得住，足够安身立命，也才值得人赌上前途去学习。", "char_start": 48, "char_end": 84}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "不是简单的“能做”而已，是要能长期的保持价值，作品得到珍视，在买家和消费者之中口耳相传，有不可替代的私人价值，这才托得起年轻人的生命。", "char_start": 85, "char_end": 152}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这东西需要一个“即使机器能做，即使机器做得更好，人们仍然会选择手工”的理由来保证安全。", "char_start": 153, "char_end": 196}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "否则的话，那只是一门普通的手工技术，花费了心血去学习，却很可能被自动化技术随时取代，自然很难让人下得了决心去钻研、练习了。", "char_start": 197, "char_end": 258}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这样的手艺生态位的其实是相当狭窄的。", "char_start": 259, "char_end": 277}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "世界上的类似生态位，普遍的和信仰有一定关系。", "char_start": 278, "char_end": 300}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "例如日本祭典用的大鼓，例如一些民族节日用的传统食物，例如一些孩童成人礼的纪念性礼物。", "char_start": 301, "char_end": 343}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这些东西往往带有特殊的、不可消解的精神性价值，无法被视为简单的实用物品，所以才可以成其为稳固的手艺根基。", "char_start": 344, "char_end": 396}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "比较遗憾的是，我们的文化现在高度的实用主义，类似这样的物品，往往还会背上“老登文化”的污名。", "char_start": 397, "char_end": 443}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "手艺之式微，是时代的惯性使然。", "char_start": 444, "char_end": 459}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这一点随着AI时代对实用价值的大面积攻占，可能会有新的演进和转机。", "char_start": 460, "char_end": 493}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "人心终得人心暖，须得待到心寒时。", "char_start": 494, "char_end": 510}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 14}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0602"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么现在的年轻人宁愿送外卖，也不愿意学一门手艺？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014"], "summary": "围绕“寒与微”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“什么叫一门手艺？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "什么叫一门手艺？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "48bba64b-4264-5ab0-b9cb-eddc8fd2e2b0", "source_ordinal": 4097, "reading_ordinal": 4250, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "长者有信", "published_at": "2026-09-05T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2078957259451908653/answer/2078982959680509239"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "怎么会？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 4}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "人如果不是越来越看得见那些不动声色的爱，如何称得上成长？", "char_start": 5, "char_end": 33}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "难道只有学得满肚子机械阴谋，虚无怨毒，才叫“成长”？", "char_start": 34, "char_end": 60}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "那叫退化，不叫成长。", "char_start": 61, "char_end": 71}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "人成长了，手里有功夫、心里有底气了，会更有安全感，更能冒得起对方没有恶意的险。就算猜错了，也自有能力遏制威胁，反击侵犯。", "char_start": 72, "char_end": 132}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "眼里也有神了，一个眼神、一个停顿，就知道心意。", "char_start": 133, "char_end": 156}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "也会算账了，知道那些看似疾言厉色的，其实是来不及的情真意切。", "char_start": 157, "char_end": 187}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "也知道人的难处了，知道一些失望不是人的对不起，而是人的不得已。", "char_start": 188, "char_end": 219}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "什么叫“成长”？", "char_start": 220, "char_end": 228}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "得仁为成，开心为长。", "char_start": 229, "char_end": 239}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "越成长，越能看见被辜负、被错过、被误会的爱。", "char_start": 240, "char_end": 262}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "如溪水，如洪流。", "char_start": 263, "char_end": 271}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "汪洋横流，潸然泪下。", "char_start": 272, "char_end": 282}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "咀嚼越久，品味越深，", "char_start": 283, "char_end": 293}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "怎么会不相信爱情。", "char_start": 294, "char_end": 303}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你知道这事最悲凉的是什么吗？", "char_start": 304, "char_end": 318}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "是我比你们更看得见你们如何相爱。", "char_start": 319, "char_end": 335}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "我常比你们更相信你们。", "char_start": 336, "char_end": 347}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "ta比你所相信的更爱你，你也比ta所知道的更爱ta。", "char_start": 348, "char_end": 374}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "可惜你们相遇得太早，得到了，却错过了。", "char_start": 375, "char_end": 394}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "从看不到到能看到，才叫成长。", "char_start": 395, "char_end": 409}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "成长意味着更相信爱情。", "char_start": 410, "char_end": 421}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "别搞反了。", "char_start": 422, "char_end": 427}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 23}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0602"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：成长意味着不相信爱情了吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023"], "summary": "围绕“长者有信”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“怎么会？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "怎么会？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 4, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
